<title>USA: HFB Financial increases semi-annual div.</title>
<headline>HFB Financial increases semi-annual div.</headline>
<dateline>MIDDLESBORO, Ky. 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>HFB Financial Corp said it increased its semi-annual dividend to $0.33 per share from $0.32 per share to reflect increased earnings.</p>
<p>The dividend is to be paid March 30 to shareholders of record on March 15.</p>
</text>
